# Mosquitto ACL file
#
# This file is now generated from the devices registry.
# Do NOT edit it by hand — run:
#   uv run python -m app.scripts.generate_mosquitto_acl --out deploy/mosquitto/aclfile
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
# The previous rule (`pattern readwrite cortai/+/+/edge/%u/+`) allowed a device to publish
# to any org/property as long as device_id matched. That breaks tenant isolation.
#
# The generated ACL binds:
# - `{org}` to the device's org slug
# - `{property}` to the device's property slug when it is bound to a property
#
# (plus a privileged `edge-ingest` user that can subscribe to all device topics).

